        ":question/problem": "Find $a\\cdot (b\\times c)$ given that $a=⟨-\\sqrt{8},\\,4,\\,-3⟩$ and $b\\times c=⟨\\sqrt{8},\\,-1,\\,2⟩.$\n\n$a\\cdot (b\\times c)=$\n{{field-1}}",
